": \"https://www.iea.org/articles/electric-cars-faq\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Battery manufacturing represents a significant environmental impact of EVs, particularly in mining for lithium, cobalt, and nickel, though recycling initiatives are being developed to address this.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/technology-roadmap-energy-storage\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Electric buses and trucks are becoming commercially viable, with several manufacturers producing electric commercial vehicles for public transit and logistics applications.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/articles/electric-buses\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
